    apply (fire_via_ovf_lift tm Cc Hi (StD, S0)).
    intros p1 j1 E1. apply (fire_lift_of_csteps tm Cc).
    apply (fireo_0RB1RD_1RC0LD_0LA1RB_1LD0LA [SCycL 2 0; SWin 2; SWinL 3] (StD, S0) ltac:(vm_compute; reflexivity)
